  "contribution": {
    "summary": "Qualify the final original C03 T2 cross-family risk gate with explicit unit, discrete-sampling and linear-topology policies. Recover one compiled missing-API RED and pass 78 GREEN, 758 retained scientific tests, four Math regressions and six SHA-identical isolated preview.12 NuGet consumers. Close C03-T2 R/G/V, T2 and parent C03 only. Keep M6-W02/M6 in-progress and C04/C05 planned, without public package or error theorem.",
    "value": "Compose seven previously qualified S01/S02/S03 conservative audits into one typed all-or-nothing boundary result with a precise family refusal reason, pre-cancellation and no exposed partial numeric result. Caller-owned frames, units, sampling and linear topology are explicit acknowledgements, not automatic validation of physical compatibility.",
    "nextAction": "After durable RS100 success, prepare RS101 on M6-W02-C04-T1: bounded pure financial math with explicit rate/discount conventions and independent 100/1.1 = 1000/11 and [-100,110] IRR = 10% oracles. Avoid market data or financial recommendations. Keep C04-T2, C05, M6-W02 and M6 open.",
    "debtChanges": [
      "Observe one independently compiled missing cross-family boundary API RED before staging source; no compiler-error substitution.",
      "Recover RED with 78 independent GREEN checks for canonical seven-family oracles, explicit caller policies, cancellation and typed reason precedence.",
      "Accept caller-managed independent Cartesian, signal and time/value units explicitly, without asserting unit compatibility or implicit conversion.",
      "Use existing S01 geometry distance/projection and S02 direct DFT/convolution conservative audits, including refused zero/cancelling risk cases.",
      "Use existing S03 uniform time-grid, relative difference and signed mean cancellation audits with explicitly supplied sampleTimes.",
      "Never leak any prior numeric family result if a later family refuses; preserve one typed per-family refusal reason and cancel first.",
      "Retain 57 parent C03-T1, 107 S03-T2, 61 S03-T1, 69 S02-T2, 60 S02-T1, 53 S01-T2, 25 S01-T1 and 326 C01/C02 tests plus four Math regressions.",
      "Pack and inspect one actual scientific preview.12 net10 NuGet archive, nuspec identity, zero foreign dependencies, byte length and SHA-256.",
      "Run six independently restored source-free eight-probe clients from a single cleared local feed, each pinned to preview.12 with identical inspected SHA.",
      "Close only original C03-T2-R/G/V, T2 and parent C03; M6-W02 and M6 stay in-progress, C04/C05 remain planned."
    ],
    "achievements": [
      {
        "projectNode": "M6-W02-C03-T2-R",
        "achievement": "Observe one independently compiled missing-public cross-family boundary API RED before sidecar implementation is staged."
      },
      {
        "projectNode": "M6-W02-C03-T2-G",
        "achievement": "Recover RED and pass 78 independent seven-family numerical, explicit-policy, typed-refusal and no-partial-data GREEN tests."
      },
      {
        "projectNode": "M6-W02-C03-T2-V",
        "achievement": "Preserve 758 scientific tests and four Math regressions; SHA-verify one actual preview.12 archive through six isolated eight-probe NuGet clients."
      },
      {
        "projectNode": "M6-W02-C03-T2",
        "achievement": "Qualify original C03-T2 conservative cross-family integration over seven S01/S02/S03 audits with explicit caller responsibilities."
      },
      {
        "projectNode": "M6-W02-C03",
        "achievement": "Close original size-L C03 only after independently qualified S01/S02/S03, original T1 and original T2 have durable evidence; leave C04/C05/W02/M6 open."
      }
    ]
  },
